[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5160.95, "timestamp": "01:26:00", "text": "哦，难道我进入这个行业的唯一原因不是这样吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5163.75, "timestamp": "01:26:03", "text": "那是因为……嗯？你还没有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5165.669, "timestamp": "01:26:05", "text": "没关系。没关系。呃，你还没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5169.11, "timestamp": "01:26:09", "text": "是自己玩上原神还是别人授予的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5173.35, "timestamp": "01:26:13", "text": "不，几年前我试过，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5175.43, "timestamp": "01:26:15", "text": "就是做不到。我当时很喜欢它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5180.55, "timestamp": "01:26:20", "text": "从它刚问世的时候就开始了，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5186.87, "timestamp": "01:26:26", "text": "打扰一下。对不起。没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5188.75, "timestamp": "01:26:28", "text": "我也接到了电话。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5193.35, "timestamp": "01:26:33", "text": "没有。哦，是的。你很快就会知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5200.95, "timestamp": "01:26:40", "text": "嗯。是的。你刚才说的是原神。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5204.95, "timestamp": "01:26:44", "text": "呃，我忘了我刚才要说什么了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5208.99, "timestamp": "01:26:48", "text": "就像你投入其中一样，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5212.47, "timestamp": "01:26:52", "text": "嗯，你当时也玩原神了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5214.31, "timestamp": "01:26:54", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5217.189, "timestamp": "01:26:57", "text": "嗯，是的，然后你，嗯，然后之后呢？"}]